Sample Input
 
Enter total population: 1000
Enter initial infected individuals: 5
Enter infection rate (0-1): 0.30
Enter recovery rate (0-1): 0.10
Enter number of simulation days: 60
 
 
 
Sample Output (First Few Days)
 
DAY SUSCEPTIBLE INFECTED RECOVERED
 
0   995     5       0
 
 
 
# SIMULATION
 
-------------------------------------------------------
 
for day in range(1, days + 1):
 
new_infections = infection_rate * S * I / population
new_recoveries = recovery_rate * I
 
S = S - new_infections
I = I + new_infections - new_recoveries
R = R + new_recoveries
 
susceptible.append(S)
infected.append(I)
recovered.append(R)
day_list.append(day)
 
print(f"{day}\t{S:.0f}\t{I:.0f}\t{R:.0f}")
 
